        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "3ed6b53e-07ee-3cec-95b1-bf901bc31630",
                "word": "RAID",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "362320fe-199b-3904-8afb-850b6364aef8",
                        "entry_id": "3ed6b53e-07ee-3cec-95b1-bf901bc31630",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Unité d'élite de la police nationale française."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "France"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "51532afa-431a-4d2f-9382-c9085ef4db69",
                                "sense_id": "362320fe-199b-3904-8afb-850b6364aef8",
                                "text": "Un homme de 24 ans se réclamant d'Al-Qaida et fortement soupçonné d'être le tueur au scooter était cerné mercredi 21 mars à l'aube dans un quartier résidentiel de Toulouse par le RAID et la police enquêtant sur la série d'assassinats hors du commun qui ont choqué la France."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc1f02e3-4e5f-411e-b97e-c2fc052f38bf",
                                "sense_id": "362320fe-199b-3904-8afb-850b6364aef8",
                                "text": "Donc, sur ce genre de prise d'otages, on rentre. […]. Pour le Bataclan, l'affaire est trop lente, car la BRI et le RAID se pignolent pendant une heure et demie pour savoir qui va y aller."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b91e3e79-b099-4136-b490-395dccf2ca3c",
                                "sense_id": "362320fe-199b-3904-8afb-850b6364aef8",
                                "text": "Les hommes cagoulés, en gilet pare-balles et combinaison marquée de l'écusson à la panthère noire, emblème du RAID, avançaient sans bruit dans le jardin sauvage envahi par des véhicules."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "78479a6f-99a2-3165-9c9d-ec8efd632b65",
                "word": "raid",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8e07673d-f319-43c2-a272-23c2ecb3229f",
                        "entry_id": "78479a6f-99a2-3165-9c9d-ec8efd632b65",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "raids"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "655b0f0a-054b-37e4-be04-031adf56e6d3",
                        "entry_id": "78479a6f-99a2-3165-9c9d-ec8efd632b65",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Incursion rapide en territoire ennemi."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "61de39d3-cd4c-407a-9140-7ef86f5d213f",
                                "sense_id": "655b0f0a-054b-37e4-be04-031adf56e6d3",
                                "text": "Il me dit que les tanks avaient percé les lignes de défense allemandes et avaient entrepris un raid à l’arrière des lignes ennemies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80de6d62-159c-472e-b8a1-b719722db087",
                                "sense_id": "655b0f0a-054b-37e4-be04-031adf56e6d3",
                                "text": "Boris Johnson raconte que le lieutenant-général de l'armée britannique, Doug Chalmers, lui avait dit qu'un raid avec de petites embarcations pour traverser la Manche et naviguer dans les canaux néerlandais serait possible, tout en l'avertissant des conséquences diplomatiques. \"Si nous sommes détectés, nous devrons expliquer pourquoi nous envahissons, de fait, un allié de longue date au sein de l'Otan\", l'avait alors prévenu Doug Chalmers, selon l'extrait mis en ligne par le Daily Mail(Nouvelle fenêtre)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "69ec3260-e585-3f4b-9aca-cf927edfbd36",
                        "entry_id": "78479a6f-99a2-3165-9c9d-ec8efd632b65",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Raid financier : Tentative de prise de contrôle d’une société par l’achat massif de ses actions, le plus souvent à prime."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ede0b2a-c1d9-30c2-9e8f-85b6f88d0673",
                        "entry_id": "78479a6f-99a2-3165-9c9d-ec8efd632b65",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Opération, généralement de faible envergure, comportant une incursion rapide en territoire ennemi pour recueillir des renseignements, semer la confusion chez l’adversaire ou détruire ses installations, et qui se termine par un repli préparé après exécution de la mission reçue. — (OTAN AAP-6)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4e267514-7324-3218-b263-d3dbd464b102",
                        "entry_id": "78479a6f-99a2-3165-9c9d-ec8efd632b65",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Épreuve d’endurance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b6a99e8-a5f8-4d65-8cfc-6a874c5721e1",
                                "sense_id": "4e267514-7324-3218-b263-d3dbd464b102",
                                "text": "Ayant conquis l’Atlantique, il ne nous restait plus qu’à atteindre New-York, l’objectif de notre raid."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b8f59417-1843-408a-90c2-59d13f523221",
                        "source_entry_id": "78479a6f-99a2-3165-9c9d-ec8efd632b65",
                        "target_lang_word": "Raubzug",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Raubzug",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "540a97f3-d14e-35b5-bc8c-375a2fcc6f18",
                                        "entry_id": "459fe84f-18ac-3095-b4f4-da5ba2c4e13a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "räuberische Unternehmung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b2bc58b-d34a-4fec-8269-26f07527fa2d",
                                                "sense_id": "540a97f3-d14e-35b5-bc8c-375a2fcc6f18",
                                                "text": "„Bereits in den 840er Jahren begannen sich die Raubzüge an der französischen und spanischen Küste nach Süden auszuweiten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d9286b6-cd7e-4df0-87ef-b07bb8220db3",
                                                "sense_id": "540a97f3-d14e-35b5-bc8c-375a2fcc6f18",
                                                "text": "„In der Nacht gab es in mehreren Stadtteilen heftige Auseinandersetzungen. In Ealing im Westen gingen maskierte Jugendliche auf Raubzug und setzten dabei Mülltonnen in Brand.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d353b2c8-8158-4ba0-8150-e87c1e60112d",
                                                "sense_id": "540a97f3-d14e-35b5-bc8c-375a2fcc6f18",
                                                "text": "„Gelegentlich fahren die Seeleute aus den Hafenstädten Nordafrikas aber auch zu Raubzügen aus, um als Piraten Jagd auf Handelsschiffe zu machen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0f9ff7a-cbc3-4d78-aba6-9923014f9da0",
                                                "sense_id": "540a97f3-d14e-35b5-bc8c-375a2fcc6f18",
                                                "text": "„Diese Unzufriedenen waren die Aggressoren in den Townships, die Züge mit Steinen bewarfen, Autos stahlen und die Gegend mit dreisten Raubzügen terrorisierten, die die Zahlen der Kriminalstatistik in die Höhe trieben.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3f53f70-20f7-4585-aceb-23332b1df9ca",
                                                "sense_id": "540a97f3-d14e-35b5-bc8c-375a2fcc6f18",
                                                "text": "„Ein großes Heer der Marathen traf dort auf den afghanischen Eroberer Ahmad Shah Durrani, der ähnlich wie einst Mahmud von Ghazni zu periodischen Raubzügen nach Indien einfiel, ohne sich dauerhaft dort zu engagieren.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "301552d5-003a-41d1-b9c7-5dfb130f155d",
                                                "sense_id": "540a97f3-d14e-35b5-bc8c-375a2fcc6f18",
                                                "text": "„Zwischen 1001 und 1026 unternahm Mahmud mehrere Raubzüge nach Indien, die ihn bis in den Sindh nach Rajputan und in die Gangesebene führten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eecd7545-bcc9-45e7-958e-40cc588e1074",
                        "source_entry_id": "78479a6f-99a2-3165-9c9d-ec8efd632b65",
                        "target_lang_word": "raid",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "raid",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "12537c1a-7293-3f49-aeb7-285e5879ef0e",
                                        "entry_id": "782476c2-aef2-3049-929b-bd3605c16ef2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A quick hostile or predatory incursion or invasion in a battle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5fd2c82a-500b-493a-9c12-03e660926dd3",
                                                "sense_id": "12537c1a-7293-3f49-aeb7-285e5879ef0e",
                                                "text": "Marauding chief! his sole delight / The moonlight raid, the morning fight."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa179b6f-3f0b-4b34-becd-01ab335adf36",
                                                "sense_id": "12537c1a-7293-3f49-aeb7-285e5879ef0e",
                                                "text": "There are permanent conquests, temporary occupation, and occasional raids."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "945adb23-65b4-3f59-b775-aec5647f1ac3",
                                        "entry_id": "782476c2-aef2-3049-929b-bd3605c16ef2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An attack or invasion for the purpose of making arrests, seizing property, or plundering."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b21622b0-1367-4cc9-bcab-579bf7158ba1",
                                                "sense_id": "945adb23-65b4-3f59-b775-aec5647f1ac3",
                                                "text": "a police raid of a narcotics factory"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea096cae-271a-4bd4-adf4-622402042171",
                                                "sense_id": "945adb23-65b4-3f59-b775-aec5647f1ac3",
                                                "text": "a raid of contractors on the public treasury"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c9ebcca-34b5-451a-b7d7-a32eedad3487",
                                                "sense_id": "945adb23-65b4-3f59-b775-aec5647f1ac3",
                                                "text": "For Lothian and Borders Police, the early-morning raid had come at the end one of biggest investigations carried out by the force, which had originally presented a dossier of evidence on the murder of Jodi Jones to the Edinburgh procurator-fiscal, William Gallagher, on 25 November last year."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5751eb3d-44e4-3d93-a9e2-5d7812897c15",
                                        "entry_id": "782476c2-aef2-3049-929b-bd3605c16ef2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An attacking movement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3a08824-5387-4c0f-8be1-9d263bd8b55c",
                                                "sense_id": "5751eb3d-44e4-3d93-a9e2-5d7812897c15",
                                                "text": "The athletic Walker, one of Tottenham's more effective attacking elements with his raids from right-back, made a timely intervention after Rose had been dispossessed and even Aaron Lennon was needed to provide an interception in the danger zone to foil another attempt by the Russians."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0c1ce5a-a199-39b1-9a20-118a9057f9db",
                                        "entry_id": "782476c2-aef2-3049-929b-bd3605c16ef2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An activity initiated at or towards the end of a live broadcast by the broadcaster that sends its viewers to a different broadcast, primarily intended to boost the viewership of the receiving broadcaster. This is frequently accompanied by a message in the form of a hashtag that is posted in the broadcast's chat by the viewers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12510d2c-180e-459b-966f-834670a4d5de",
                                                "sense_id": "c0c1ce5a-a199-39b1-9a20-118a9057f9db",
                                                "text": "Now that Twitch is making raids an official part of the platform, however, some streamers think the new feature will make it easier to participate in the positive aspects of raiding."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3b36658-0093-4967-a2b4-b32901ee4a26",
                                                "sense_id": "c0c1ce5a-a199-39b1-9a20-118a9057f9db",
                                                "text": "Now streamers can use a new feature that lets their viewers join a raid then drive traffic to another streamer with just a click."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71c84ab9-8871-3f8c-b42c-3d8bf694b38b",
                                        "entry_id": "782476c2-aef2-3049-929b-bd3605c16ef2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large group in a massively multiplayer online game, consisting of multiple parties who team up to defeat a powerful enemy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "957eaa73-c868-3143-9ead-f5dd0f243c6b",
                                        "entry_id": "782476c2-aef2-3049-929b-bd3605c16ef2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An event involving a group of users, often using bots and scripts, who join a server to harm it or harass its members."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "162d50de-57dd-40cf-8846-da65a97ac668",
                                                "sense_id": "957eaa73-c868-3143-9ead-f5dd0f243c6b",
                                                "text": "I used the tools discord gave me to prevent raids but he somehow knows a bypass, I use bots and they do help prevent it but just having him ping 90 guys once makes people bash me for an entire hour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb81a46a-059f-4604-929a-fefc565af40a",
                                                "sense_id": "957eaa73-c868-3143-9ead-f5dd0f243c6b",
                                                "text": "Raids are a problem on Guilded. I have been in many servers that have been raided by a user with an account gen or even just some users looking to cause trouble and ruin the communities for us [...]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "raid",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff9b6b82-dcf6-3264-8c24-1940cebb30ce",
                                        "entry_id": "9dd04e0d-3d2d-3512-aa26-d9d663ffe70d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To engage in a raid against."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62a4ecc1-2302-447c-82ce-e8c0c0de8b63",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9b6b82-dcf6-3264-8c24-1940cebb30ce",
                                                "text": "The police raided the gambling den."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d5c8f8b-dde5-4f5f-a108-ee794e2fab5b",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9b6b82-dcf6-3264-8c24-1940cebb30ce",
                                                "text": "The soldiers raided the village and burned it down."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10478980-3a24-4c84-84c6-1dc1269beb73",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9b6b82-dcf6-3264-8c24-1940cebb30ce",
                                                "text": "A group of mobsters raided an art museum and stole a bunch of paintings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03685b44-5799-492e-ba7e-7640c6f6a217",
                                                "sense_id": "ff9b6b82-dcf6-3264-8c24-1940cebb30ce",
